# One entry per line: ID PATH [TEXT]

# The exact string sshd prints when a forced command meets nologin. It is quoted data,
# and the word inside it that reads as an anchor belongs to sshd, not to this comment
moment roles/metrics/tasks/main.yml This account is currently not available

# Two pointers that name their entry by its heading and keep only the local fact. What
# they still share with it is the vocabulary a pointer cannot avoid - the entry's own
# title, /usr/bin/x-ui, "an intake on the tunnel". The rule measures a share of the
# comment's three-word runs, so the shorter a correct pointer gets the higher that share
# climbs: shortening the checker one from four lines to two moved it from 16% to 20%
duplicate-doc roles/checker/defaults/main.yml DEVIATIONS.md
duplicate-doc roles/xui/defaults/main.yml WORKAROUNDS.md
